	(text "BQ24073 linear charger with power path (DPPM): runs MAO from USB while charging. USB500 input limit (EN2=0, EN1=+3V3), ISET 4.3k = 207 mA charge (cell maximum 250 mA ="
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 143.51 82.55 0)
		(effects
			(font (size 1 1))
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "bf925ad8-8c0a-59c9-abb2-b4fa58d4dfad")
	)
	(text "0.5C), ILIM 1.5k, default timers. Pack NTC on TS: the charger stops outside 0-50 C; the cell allows 0-45 C, so firmware pauses charging through /CE (expander P6) above"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 143.51 83.82 0)
		(effects
			(font (size 1 1))
