			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "ace496ed-f77c-5e3f-8891-19afd365c2fe")
	)
	(text "its own protection PCM and a 10k NTC. R108 = 0R link to measure battery current (110). Q101 blocks a"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 147.32 0)
		(effects
			(font (size 1 1))
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "0ca6550f-1d78-57b9-928c-e3a7f702c49c")
	)
	(text "reversed cell (51); with USB in, the charger stays in its 4-11 mA short probe. R110 fits only for cells"
